-\label{tab:frontier}
-\begin{tabular}{p{.55\linewidth}r p{.25\linewidth}}
-\toprule
-Primary class & Files & Current handling \\
-\midrule
-Literal policy in pinned source & 5 & candidate for direct normalization \\
-Constant-foldable HCL & 2 & needs expression evaluation \\
-Caller/module instantiation & 15 & needs resolved plan/module inputs \\
-Host-language generation & 1 & needs synthesis or language front end \\
