+\label{sec:cases}
+The reconstructed change study contains \PublicCommits{} frozen commits, \PublicRoles{} role contracts, and \PublicConfigurations{} evaluated configurations. Twenty configurations are ordinary before/after role phases; one is an additional branch for an unresolved input variable. The outcomes are \PublicPass{} \Pass{}, \PublicFail{} \Fail{}, and \PublicUnknown{} \Unknown{}. These are adapter outcomes for supplied models, not a repair-success rate.
