+
+The micheleformenti case changes from \Fail{} to \Unknown{}, not to \Pass{}~\cite{change-michele}. The reconstructed after-policy depends on an environment-governance premise that the supplied material does not establish sufficiently for that judgment. Treating every narrowing commit as a completed repair would erase precisely the distinction that the three-outcome method is intended to preserve.
